<Base title="Contact" description="Contact GEAR Moto Foundation for general inquiries, partnerships, event hosting and community involvement.">
<section class="inner-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Start a Conversation</div><h1>Get in Touch.<br/><span class="accent">Get in GEAR.</span></h1></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap prose"><h2>One Foundation. Many Ways to Connect.</h2><p>Whether you're a rider, training provider, shop, potential sponsor, event host or community volunteer, we welcome general inquiries about our developing mission.</p><p><strong>Primary contact:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@gearmotofoundation.org">info@gearmotofoundation.org</a></p><h2>What to Include</h2><p>Tell us whether your interest is partnerships, rider education, gear donations, event hosting, volunteering or general program questions. Please include a way for us to respond.</p><div class="program-callout"><strong>Your privacy matters:</strong> Do not email medical records, accident reports, claim numbers, financial statements or other sensitive application materials. Financial and medical assistance applications are not currently open.</div><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-red" href="mailto:info@gearmotofoundation.org?subject=GEAR%20Moto%20Foundation%20Inquiry">Email GEAR</a></div></div></section></Base>